s("S0220","Large red outlined block lettering reading PRICES at x0.20-0.54 y0.40-0.65; vertical kitchen knife with brown handle at x0.55-0.63 y0.02-0.65.",WB,"Marker-style bold red letters with black outline and slight wobble; knife with grey steel blade and dark brown handle, black outline, flat fill.","Display hand-lettered caps, about 18% of frame height, red fill with black outline.","PRICES","","Lettering is largest and reddest, knife poised above it second.","Hard replace from EP0297; exit at EP0298 when the knife swings.","INFERRED: sets up a price-cut metaphor (ASR: a price cut can't) with a knife about to cut the word.","HIGH","Same lettering and knife continue in S0221; knife returns at S0226.","Centre a bold red hand-lettered word on white, with a vertical kitchen knife prop at the upper right of the word. Cut in on one frame, hold under one second, then swap the knife to a slicing pose.","A white canvas with giant hand-lettered red capital letters outlined in black spelling a single word at left-centre and a large vertical kitchen knife with brown handle poised at the upper right, flat cartoon style.","F3 object/icon cluster")
