s("S0224","Huge close-up of a black-haired character at x0.5-0.97 y0.0-1.0, head about 0.35w; green dollar bill held at lower left of body x0.45-0.58 y0.45-0.65.",WB,"Thick black outline, flat beige skin, solid black hair mass, worried eyebrows and tiny dot eyes; bill is green with yellow dollar mark in a grey circle.","none","","","Giant face first, bill second.","Hard replace EP0304; additive bubble EP0305 ends the state.","INFERRED: reaction beat as the buyer weighs a tiny budget (ASR: when price cuts stop bringing...).","HIGH","Same character continues in S0225.","Cut to a close-up of a hand-drawn black-haired character on the right half of frame holding one green bill at lower left, scale head to 50% of frame height.","A flat white canvas dominated by a huge hand-drawn stick character with a solid black hair mass and worried brow on the right half, holding a single green dollar bill at lower left, thick black outlines.","F1 character-only")
